## Fix Delta CTAS: drop explicit schema from RTAS

Context: Databricks rejects ``CREATE OR REPLACE TABLE … (cols) … AS SELECT`` — schema
must be inferred from the SELECT. Delta triple-store materialize failed with
"Schema may not be specified in a Replace Table As Select (RTAS) statement".

Changes:

1. src/back/core/graphdb/delta/materialize.py
   Removed ``(subject STRING, …)`` from ``build_ctas_sql``; RTAS uses VIEW column types.
2. tests/units/graphdb/delta/test_delta_package.py
   Assert generated SQL omits explicit column list.

Modified files:
- src/back/core/graphdb/delta/materialize.py
- tests/units/graphdb/delta/test_delta_package.py

