## Fix SWRL inference on Delta (logical graph name → UC FQN)

Context: SWRL (and other reasoning SQL) used ``Cust360Auto_V5`` via
``ReasoningService._get_graph_name()``. Lakebase maps that to ``g_cust360auto_v5``
through ``_sql_relation``; ``DeltaFlatStore`` passed the logical name through unchanged,
so inference SQL queried a non-existent relation and returned zero findings.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaFlatStore.py
   ``_sql_relation`` / ``physical_table_id`` resolve to ``…_graph`` (or ``…_data`` fallback).
2. tests/units/graphdb/delta/test_delta_flat_store.py
   SQL reference resolution tests.

Modified files:
- src/back/core/graphdb/delta/DeltaFlatStore.py
- tests/units/graphdb/delta/test_delta_flat_store.py

